    "Is the \"at least 12 units of type D\" requirement per container a hard requirement that applies to every container used, or is it a target that can be relaxed if needed?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a single clarification question asking for a policy choice regarding the strictness of a specific constraint."
}

